msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Нелли..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4628AC94_86B1_412F_AF1B_3E7270C71B3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
