msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫............"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E681D104_B68C_446D_B5FE_E46E6C1477B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e68850070a5d6d7fb94bf346e8df66ebda05c46c6f230bc8caa8a54eb5232e2
