#: scenario8:scenario8_8679902E_3CEE_4D0F_88B8_EFC38308A715
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6c27de8cfdd76aa0307a0b9f38a706769833c96344d095c1768a5b5885d741b
#. default-sha256: 2de4d95c39f795b96517f373d2d44f7e7dfa0702be9bcf0be106ba1d3da5beab
